		</li> 
		<li id="LI_1DC713FCDBC9434E9FDE2525DE3CF3E0"> MTRR Configurations for 1 TB Memory. For more details, refer to 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052.dita#GUID-2A5D671C-9660-41C7-9F68-B8047FEDC052"><?xm-replace_text MTRR Configurations for 1TB Memory?></xref>. 
